<title>JAPAN: RESEARCH ALERT-General Sekiyu rated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-General Sekiyu rated.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yamaichi Research Institute of Securities and Economics Inc said it has assigned General Sekiyu KK a &quot;3&quot; rating.</p>
<p>In its three-grade rating system, the research institute assigns a &quot;3&quot; rating to issues whose values it expects</p>
<p>will underperform the Tokyo Stock Exchange first-section TOPIX index by </p>
<p>more than 10 percentage points over the following six months.</p>
</text>
